CLAUDE.md
# Local Claude Code permissions (machine-specific) and the timestamped
# backups Claude Code writes beside them. Shared project config under
# .claude/ (settings.json, skills, hooks, agents) stays committable.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/*.bak.*
.claude/settings.local.json.bak.*

# graphify knowledge graph — regenerable from the corpus via /graphify,
